Run commands on devices and manage saved command shortcuts.
Devices: host_N, observer_N, ct_<id>, vm_<id> — containers/VMs run via their current host (pct exec / qm guest exec).

  script <device> <script> [options…]      run a device script — list + options from the mirror (Tab)
  run <device> --cmd "…" [--save <alias>]   run once, optionally keep it as shortcut
  alias <alias> [--device …] [--set k=v]    run a saved shortcut (default: all its devices)
  save <alias> --cmd "…" --device …         save without running
  list [--device …]                         show saved shortcuts
  edit <alias> [--cmd … | --description … | --new-alias … | --add-device … | --remove-device …]
                                            without options: edit the whole entry in $EDITOR
  delete <alias>                            remove a shortcut

Observers log in as fadmin — prefix commands that need root with sudo.
